        <!-- Notes box (text) -->
        <mxCell id="n-outcome" value="Outcome&#10;• Graph view shows the cross-link recipe visually (60 explicit edges across 30 occupation skills, plus persona neuron edges pointing back into the base methodology).&#10;• Each note's backlinks panel shows reverse references.&#10;• Color-by-tag groups CI/CD vs observability vs incident etc.&#10;• Stock Obsidian: no plugins, no manifest required for graph view to work. The .obsidian/graph.json is the preset — graph still works without it, just with default greys.&#10;• CODE-vs-SPEC DRIFT: spec section 3 said 'no .obsidian/graph.json shipped'. Code DOES ship one per the curation-side _polish_vault_with_graph_json post-step." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#92400E;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
